          "name": "decode",
          "expression": "V.yzw = Directional.rgb * NormalizedAmbientColor, NormalizedAmbientColor = AmbientRGB/(Luminance(AmbientRGB)+1e-5)",
          "requires": [
            "SHLighting1",
            "SHLighting0"
          ],
          "sourceRefs": [
            "part2.tv.ush.color",
            "part2.tv.ush.dir"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "mathTerms": [
        "The compression loses per-channel directionality: only the luminance-weighted direction survives, and the colour ratio is reconstructed from the ambient channel (LumenTranslucencyVolumeShared.ush:61-66).",
        "Component order is SH V.y, V.z, V.w; the two-band basis is V=(0.282095, -0.488603*y, +0.488603*z, -0.488603*x) (SHCommon.ush:221-229), so the three components are ordered (y, z, x) and carry signs. Do not rename them (x,y,z) or drop the signs."
      ],
      "producerSources": [
