        "part2.tv.usf.sh.write1"
      ],
      "consumerSources": [
        "part2.tv.ush.dir"
      ],
      "gaps": [
        "The stored values are not per-channel SH coefficients; applying them directly as RGB SH (without multiplying by NormalizedAmbientColor) is wrong.",
